  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "See https://github.com/JefferyLeo/boostgrid/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md for the full per-version log. v2.5.3 fixes the column-visibility checkbox staying visually stuck (the delegated click handler was cancelling the checkbox's native toggle via preventDefault); columns still showed/hid correctly but the box never updated. v2.5.2 added a host-page dependency guard (console.warn when Bootstrap's JS bundle is missing) plus docs spelling out the required host-page loads. v2.5.1 fixed the CDN script-tag MIME issue (.umd.cjs → .umd.js mirror). v2.5.0 introduced element pooling under virtual scroll and the scrollToRow(index) public method. Bundle 16.7 KB brotli, ceiling 18 KB.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Bootstrap 5 data grid (vanilla TypeScript, under 18 KB brotli, zero runtime dependencies).",
